# 13. Bhagavad Gītā-specific LLM evaluations

There are also narrowly scoped evaluations rather than reusable benchmarks.

### Google Translate evaluation, 2023

`https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.07201`

They compare Google Sanskrit→English outputs to expert Bhagavad-gītā translations using BERT-derived semantic/sentiment analyses plus qualitative inspection. ([arXiv][14])

### LLM + Google comparison, 2025

`https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.21393`

Compares GPT/Gemini/Google Translate with expert translations for Sanskrit Bhagavad-gītā alongside Hindi and Telugu literary texts. ([arXiv][15])

Useful historical evaluations, but **sentiment preservation is nowhere near sufficient as a translation-fidelity metric for philosophical Sanskrit**.

